            p: ["Log each comment and fix", "Cut slides that don't support the ask", "Re-time with Rehearse Timings", "Prepare hidden backup slides for likely questions"],
            k: ["comment", "presenter", "slideUp", "slideDown"],
            tip: "List the **5 hardest questions** an investor could ask and build a hidden backup slide for each.",
